/* memory ... LithoRoot std L3 (S3, 2026-11-16): allocator, allocator_traits
 * (minimal), pointer_traits/to_address, construct_at/destroy_at, the
 * uninitialized algorithms, unique_ptr (+array, deleters), shared_ptr /
 * weak_ptr / make_shared / enable_shared_from_this.
 *
 * Lock-free (standing rule): the shared_ptr control block counts with
 * __atomic builtins only, which are single wasm atomic RMW instructions
 * under -matomics. Release on decrement, an acquire fence before the
 * destroy, exactly the usual protocol. No atomic<shared_ptr> (plan 1.3). */
#ifndef LITHOROOT_MEMORY
#define LITHOROOT_MEMORY
